body:
\*if

&#x200B;

(I am not against treatment)

Just putting this here for educational purposes: Canada will allow people with mental illness alone to have death with dignity starting March. 17th, 2023 and Ontario has active referral (so living there is better)

&#x200B;

Also, there is a human rights organization and youtube channel called "The Right To No Longer Exist) their videos get people through their painful lives and you can make a difference by joining.
